# Manual force-tunnel domains (fresh-install seed).
# Merged into the amnezia_force4 nft set via dnsmasq nftset directives, so
# every resolved IP (incl. rotating CDN IPs) is routed through the tunnel in
# direct-default mode. One domain per line; a bare apex also matches all
# subdomains (dnsmasq suffix match). Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# This seed is copied to /etc/amnezia/force-tunnel.list only if that file is
# absent (first install); an existing device keeps its own runtime list.

# Google Meet page + media (media servers are RU-throttled on the direct path)
meet.google.com

# Cursor / WorkOS auth chain — the SPA's XHRs to api.workos.com are
# RU-throttled direct; tunneling the whole chain fixes the blank login page.
# (cursor.sh also covers Cursor's api2 AI backend.)
workos.com
cursor.sh
